[63.821528, "o", "An approval is valid when approval_status is approved (after normalizing case and surrounding\r\nwhitespace), effective_date is on or before migration_effective_date, and expiry_date is on or after\r\nmigration_effective_date.\r\nA valid plan_\u001b[01;31m\u001b[Koverride\u001b[m\u001b[K replaces the mapped plan. A valid price_\u001b[01;31m\u001b[Koverride\u001b[m\u001b[K replaces the computed monthly\r\nprice.\r\n10. Rule Precedence\r\n"]
